  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Otterdance was a furry club event in the Netherlands, created by Jack Newhorse as a subsidiary of Tom Geller Productions and later run by Stichting Otterdam. It was unusual in the region for taking place in regular club spaces, such as Roodkapje in Rotterdam, rather than in rented halls. The first was held July 3, 2022, with DJ lineups at each event, and from the fourth the organization ran it under the name Stichting Otterdam. It was held between 2022 and 2024.",
